### Dev login
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/v1/auth/dev-login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "apple_subject": "local-dev-user"
}

### Search (replace TOKEN)
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/v1/search
Authorization: Bearer TOKEN
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "query": "best neighborhoods in chicago",
  "count": 5
}

### Retrieve page (replace TOKEN)
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/v1/retrieve
Authorization: Bearer TOKEN
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "url": "https://example.com/chicago-neighborhoods"
}

### Compare (replace TOKEN)
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/v1/compare
Authorization: Bearer TOKEN
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Neighborhood compare",
  "items": [
    {
      "item_id": "item_1",
      "title": "Lincoln Park",
      "url": "https://example.com/lincoln-park",
      "domain": "example.com",
      "snippet": "Walkable and family-friendly.",
      "cleaned_excerpt": "Lincoln Park offers walkability, green space, and a residential feel.",
      "bullet_points": ["Walkable", "Family-friendly"],
      "typed_metadata": {"rating": 4.7}
    },
    {
      "item_id": "item_2",
      "title": "Wicker Park",
      "url": "https://example.com/wicker-park",
      "domain": "example.com",
      "snippet": "Nightlife and arts.",
      "cleaned_excerpt": "Wicker Park is known for nightlife, culture, and restaurants.",
      "bullet_points": ["Nightlife", "Artsy"],
      "typed_metadata": {"rating": 4.5}
    }
  ]
}

### Research (replace TOKEN)
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/v1/research
Authorization: Bearer TOKEN
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Neighborhood research",
  "prompt_context": "Best fit for relocation",
  "items": [
